        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-K4002, Imperial 8 Inch Front Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe urn tip ends and regal detailing give the 8 Inch Imperial Door Knocker a distinguished look making it a great choice to add elegance to any front door. It is made out of solid brass, so you can be sure that it will stand the test of time. The perfect gift for housewarming parties, the large front plate provides plenty of room for an engraved surname. This Imperial Knocker comes packaged with all the necessary installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are hand finished in the USA. They are one of the world's leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Imperial Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
